Author: rax/rxsxyy
Date: 2026-10-11
Description: Allow multiple functions/commands per bind, separated by '&'
Commit Version: 1bca1b4 (remove man references from Makefile)

Adds chaining for 'bind' and 'call' lines in sxwmrc, e.g.
"bind : mod + b : "firefox" & "st""
Actions run from left to right. '&' inside quotes are part of the commands.

